WEBVTT

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:03.810
Greetings to my fellow Iranians around the world,

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:08.830
especially the Iranian students at the University of California, Irvine.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:15.260
I’m Milad Derakhshani, born in 1363 in Isfahan.

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:18.660
I’m very happy to share this holiday with you.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:22.270
Last year was a very difficult year.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.520
We don’t want to dwell on it. To quote Khayyam:

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.840
“Never have I worried about two days… [last phrase unclear]

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.820
the day not yet come and the day already gone.”

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:38.140
I wish you good health in the coming year, and dedicate this performance to each of you.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:42.240
I hope watching it helps you set aside the difficulties of the past year

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:48.420
for a moment, think about the future, and feel refreshed.

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:55.320
I also want to thank the Iranian student association at UCI

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:59.340
for arranging this performance. They worked very hard.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:04.330
I hope we can meet in a concert hall one day.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.810
Happy New Year in advance.

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:09.460
Goodbye.
